8-step Development Lifecycle

1.Define the problem in writing
2.Design the architecture before you build
3.Set up your environment
4.Build the smallest version first
5.Iterate with AI as your pair programmer
6.Test it, Even if Informal
7.Ship it somewhere (Deploy your project and make it available for others to use.)
8.Get on the flywheel (Keep improving the project based on feedback, learning, and usage.REPEAT)
